WEBVTT

00:00:09.630 --> 00:00:11.548
(ship creaking)

00:00:13.425 --> 00:00:15.344
(chittering)

00:00:17.429 --> 00:00:18.263
-(thud)
-Whoa!

00:00:21.642 --> 00:00:23.310
Hey, they look fluffy!
嘿 看起来毛茸茸的

00:00:23.393 --> 00:00:25.395
Hah! I get the big
woolly one.
我要那个长毛大个儿

00:00:25.479 --> 00:00:26.480
(snorting)

00:00:26.563 --> 00:00:28.357
Hah! Ha-ha.

00:00:29.691 --> 00:00:30.692
Wow.

00:00:30.776 --> 00:00:33.028
(chuckles)
(clicking teeth)

00:00:33.111 --> 00:00:35.489
Get ready to slice
and dice, boys.
准备好大卸八块吧 小的们

00:00:35.572 --> 00:00:37.074
-Knock it off, Squint.
-Hey!
你少来 斯昆特

00:00:37.157 --> 00:00:38.408
Wait for Captain's orders.
等待船长的命令

00:00:39.034 --> 00:00:40.202
GUTT: Ahoy, down there!
你好 下面的人

00:00:41.286 --> 00:00:43.288
How lucky are you?
你们太走运了

00:00:43.830 --> 00:00:46.708
You know, these waters
are infested with pirates.
你们知道 这片水域海盗横行

00:00:46.792 --> 00:00:48.669
-Right, boys?
-CREW: Arr!
是不是 伙计们

00:00:48.752 --> 00:00:50.921
Glad we found you
before they did.
我很高兴在他们之前找到了你们

00:00:51.004 --> 00:00:52.631
(grunting)

00:00:53.382 --> 00:00:55.842
Captain Gutt, here to help.
肚肚船长 为您效劳

00:00:56.260 --> 00:00:58.762
You know, that's a nice monkey.
我说 真是只不错的猴子

00:00:58.845 --> 00:01:01.473
(chittering, laughing)
(gasps)

00:01:02.307 --> 00:01:03.725
(screams)
听着 我们不想惹麻烦

00:01:03.809 --> 00:01:05.227
Look, we don't want
any trouble.
听着 我们不想惹麻烦

00:01:05.310 --> 00:01:07.312
We just need to get back
to the continent.
我们只是想返回陆地上去

00:01:07.396 --> 00:01:08.564
The continent?
返回陆地 你说那堆废墟吗

00:01:08.647 --> 00:01:09.898
That pile of rubble?
返回陆地 你说那堆废墟吗

00:01:09.982 --> 00:01:11.775
(laughter)

00:01:13.443 --> 00:01:14.695
My family's there.
我的家人在那里 所以能不能请你

00:01:14.778 --> 00:01:15.737
So if you could just...
我的家人在那里 所以能不能请你

00:01:15.821 --> 00:01:17.489
Oh, your family?
哦 你的家人 真是太温馨了

00:01:17.573 --> 00:01:19.866
That is so sweet.
哦 你的家人 真是太温馨了

00:01:19.950 --> 00:01:21.451
I hope you said good-bye.
希望你道过别了

00:01:22.035 --> 00:01:24.037
'Cause there's no way back.
因为已经回不去了

00:01:24.121 --> 00:01:25.330
Yes, there is.
可以回去的

00:01:25.414 --> 00:01:27.499
(sighs) Don't you
remember, Captain?
你不记得了吗 船长

00:01:27.583 --> 00:01:28.834
You can sail to Switchback Cove
我们可以开到回流湾然后

00:01:28.917 --> 00:01:30.460
and catch the current
back from there.
赶上反方向的洋流

00:01:30.544 --> 00:01:32.546
(chuckles) It's like
a steel trap, this noggin is.
这个脑袋的记性还真好

00:01:32.629 --> 00:01:33.463
(laughs)
这个脑袋的记性还真好

00:01:33.547 --> 00:01:35.507
Thank you, Mr. Flynn.
谢谢你 福林先生

00:01:35.591 --> 00:01:36.508
Ow!

00:01:36.592 --> 00:01:37.801
-Ooh.
-MANNY: See?
你看 我就知道有办法回家

00:01:37.884 --> 00:01:39.136
I knew there was a way home.
你看 我就知道有办法回家

00:01:39.219 --> 00:01:40.596
(echoes):
There is no home!
没有什么家了

00:01:42.889 --> 00:01:44.600
There is only here.
有的只是这儿

00:01:44.683 --> 00:01:48.270
And here,
your ship belongs to me.
在这儿 你的船得归我

00:01:49.896 --> 00:01:51.315
Battle stations!
作战队形

00:01:51.398 --> 00:01:52.232
Hah!

00:01:53.609 --> 00:01:54.568
Hah!

00:01:54.651 --> 00:01:55.736
-Arr!
-Arr!

00:01:55.819 --> 00:01:56.945
Whoo-hoo!

00:01:57.029 --> 00:01:58.405
GUTT: Fly the colors!
升起旗帜

00:02:01.241 --> 00:02:02.534
Now surrender your ship
交出你们的船

00:02:03.035 --> 00:02:05.621
or face my fury.
不然就面对我的怒火

00:02:05.704 --> 00:02:07.331
Or face your furry what?
面对你的如果什么呢

00:02:07.414 --> 00:02:10.584
Not "furry." Fury! Fire!
不是如果 是怒火

00:02:13.170 --> 00:02:14.212
(all gasp)

00:02:14.796 --> 00:02:17.049
Hit the mammoth,
win a prize! Hah!
射中猛犸 赢得大奖

00:02:17.132 --> 00:02:18.925
Ding, ding, ding, ding!

00:02:19.676 --> 00:02:20.844
Fire the starboard cannons!
右舷加农炮发射

00:02:20.927 --> 00:02:23.472
I love this job!
我爱这个工作

00:02:23.555 --> 00:02:24.681
Shira, fetch.
希拉 去吧

00:02:24.765 --> 00:02:25.766
Aye-aye, Captain.
遵命 船长

00:02:29.603 --> 00:02:30.646
Aw.
哦 你差点就成功了

00:02:30.729 --> 00:02:31.938
You almost made it.
哦 你差点就成功了

00:02:32.022 --> 00:02:33.148
I don't fight girls.
我不打女孩子

00:02:34.232 --> 00:02:35.275
(grunts)

00:02:35.359 --> 00:02:36.318
(sighs)

00:02:37.069 --> 00:02:38.070
I can see why.
我知道原因了

00:02:38.153 --> 00:02:39.738
-(screams)
-Belly flop!
肚腩猛击

00:02:40.489 --> 00:02:41.740
Ow! Ow!

00:02:41.823 --> 00:02:42.658
(laughs)
希德

00:02:42.741 --> 00:02:43.700
Sid!
希德

00:02:43.784 --> 00:02:45.744
Let's rumba, tiny.
(chuckles)
陪我玩玩 小个子

00:02:45.827 --> 00:02:47.663
Lights out, big fella.
天黑请闭眼 伙计

00:02:49.456 --> 00:02:51.500
(groans)

00:02:53.251 --> 00:02:54.586
SID: Manny!
曼尼

00:02:55.003 --> 00:02:56.922
(crew's laughter echoing) (crew's laughter echoing)

00:02:59.383 --> 00:03:00.217
(Manny sighs)

00:03:00.300 --> 00:03:02.052
(snorting)

00:03:02.886 --> 00:03:03.720
(chuckles)

00:03:03.804 --> 00:03:04.680
Hello.
你好

00:03:05.222 --> 00:03:06.139
DIEGO: Hey, buddy,
嘿 伙计

00:03:06.890 --> 00:03:08.225
welcome to the party.
欢迎参加派对

00:03:09.184 --> 00:03:10.727
(strains)

00:03:11.186 --> 00:03:12.854
Let's see what kind
of moves you got.
让我们瞧瞧你有啥本事

00:03:12.938 --> 00:03:13.980
Dance, little
Scrat fish!
跳吧 小松鼠鱼

00:03:14.064 --> 00:03:15.691
Dance your
coconuts off!
跳到椰子壳掉下来

00:03:16.066 --> 00:03:17.192
(laughs)

00:03:17.275 --> 00:03:18.527
Happy dance!
跳得开心哟

00:03:18.860 --> 00:03:19.736
-Mmm.
-SQUINT: Did you see him dance?

00:03:19.820 --> 00:03:21.863
(gasping)

00:03:22.197 --> 00:03:23.240
Oh, look at him.
哦 你看他呀

00:03:23.323 --> 00:03:24.157
(laughs)
哦 你看他呀

00:03:24.241 --> 00:03:25.492
(gasps)
Where's my booty?
我的那一坨呢

00:03:25.992 --> 00:03:27.119
Has anyone seen it?
有人看到了吗

00:03:27.202 --> 00:03:28.912
Dude, it's right
behind you.
老兄 就在你背后呀

00:03:28.995 --> 00:03:31.123
Where? Where's my booty?
(laughter)
哪里 我的那一坨在哪儿

00:03:31.206 --> 00:03:32.374
I can't see it.
我没看到啊

00:03:32.457 --> 00:03:34.167
Ugh. It's all
I can see.
我满眼都是了

00:03:34.501 --> 00:03:36.753
Whoo, this is
a lovely vacation.
真是个不错的假期 人生最棒的一次

00:03:36.837 --> 00:03:38.171
Best I've ever had.
真是个不错的假期 人生最棒的一次

00:03:38.797 --> 00:03:40.215
Morning, sunshine.
早安 宝贝儿

00:03:40.298 --> 00:03:44.344
Let me be the first to extend
the hand of friendship.
让我来首先伸出友谊之手

00:03:45.137 --> 00:03:46.054
That's your foot.
那是你的脚

00:03:46.138 --> 00:03:47.097
(chuckles)
Oh.

00:03:47.180 --> 00:03:49.182
Nothing gets by
you, does it?
啥都骗不过你 对吗

00:03:49.266 --> 00:03:50.434
What do you want?
你想要怎样

00:03:50.517 --> 00:03:54.396
I bet you're feeling
lost, scared, confused.
我猜你一定很迷茫

00:03:54.479 --> 00:03:56.356
Allow me to explain.
我来做个介绍吧

00:03:56.440 --> 00:03:57.774
Help me out, boys!
小的们 奏乐

00:03:57.858 --> 00:04:00.068
Ooh, Captain's
gonna sing a shanty!
噢 船长准备唱船歌了

00:04:00.152 --> 00:04:00.986
(crew playing
upbeat polka music)
噢 船长准备唱船歌了

00:04:01.862 --> 00:04:03.989
♪ Here you are on a boat,
you're adrift, you're afloat ♪
（歌词）上了船以后 只漂泊不停留

00:04:04.072 --> 00:04:05.449
♪ One might even say
you're stuck ♪
有人觉得自己完了

00:04:06.074 --> 00:04:07.993
♪ Well, I don't want to gloat
but I would like to note ♪
我不是在吹牛

00:04:08.076 --> 00:04:09.453
♪ That you're in luck ♪
但是你运气算不错

00:04:09.536 --> 00:04:11.955
♪ You've been saved by the ape
that rules these waters ♪
救你的猿猴统治这片海域

00:04:12.038 --> 00:04:13.707
♪ So forget about
your wives and daughters ♪
所以请你忘掉妻子儿女

00:04:14.040 --> 00:04:17.085
♪ First mate, introduce me
to them please ♪
大副请把我介绍给他们听

00:04:17.419 --> 00:04:18.837
Aye-aye, Captain Gutt.
遵命 肚肚船长

00:04:19.337 --> 00:04:21.673
♪ He's the big and scary,
elegant and hairy ♪
他高大恐怖 英俊又粗鲁

00:04:21.757 --> 00:04:24.676
♪ Fear inspiring, years from
retiring, looting, stealing ♪
凶残冷酷 经验很丰富

00:04:24.760 --> 00:04:25.677
♪ Banana-peeling ♪
劫财无数 香蕉当食物

00:04:25.761 --> 00:04:28.346
♪ Undisputed master
of the seas ♪
独一无二的海上霸主

00:04:28.430 --> 00:04:29.431
Oh, geez.
哦 天哪

00:04:29.514 --> 00:04:32.517
♪ That's me ♪
♪ 'Tis he ♪
就是我 没错

00:04:32.601 --> 00:04:33.435
Okay, okay.
行了 行了

00:04:34.811 --> 00:04:36.480
♪ I'm a primate
pirate pioneer ♪
我是灵长海盗先驱
他们都是我的兄弟

00:04:36.563 --> 00:04:38.857
♪ And these are
my brave buccaneers ♪
我是灵长海盗先驱
他们都是我的兄弟

00:04:38.940 --> 00:04:41.443
♪ All of whom were once
lost souls like you ♪
大家都曾像你这样漂泊

00:04:41.526 --> 00:04:42.527
♪ It's true ♪
说得对

00:04:42.611 --> 00:04:44.488
♪ He rescued us ♪
♪ He saved our butts ♪
他救了我

00:04:44.571 --> 00:04:46.573
♪ For that we owe
our lives to Gutt ♪
所以我们都为他效力

00:04:46.656 --> 00:04:48.742
♪ And assuming
he doesn't kill you ♪
假如他决定不杀你

00:04:48.825 --> 00:04:50.911
♪ You will owe him, too ♪
你也欠他的情

00:04:51.495 --> 00:04:52.704
Kill them?
(chuckles)
杀他们

00:04:52.788 --> 00:04:54.956
Me? No. No.
我吗 不不不

00:04:55.040 --> 00:04:59.503
Well, at least not this
very large useful mammoth.
好吧 至少不杀这个
高大有用的猛犸象

00:04:59.586 --> 00:05:00.462
Hey, hands off.
嘿 放开手

00:05:00.545 --> 00:05:01.713
-Ooh.
-Anyway...
哦 那好吧

00:05:02.547 --> 00:05:04.424
♪ Here we are on a ship
moving at quite a clip ♪
现在我这条船加速向前开

00:05:04.508 --> 00:05:05.926
♪ Through the ever-shifting ice ♪
穿过漂移的冰山

00:05:06.468 --> 00:05:07.844
♪ Come along on a trip ♪
♪ That's a hint ♪
跟我们做伙伴

00:05:07.928 --> 00:05:09.805
♪ That's a tip ♪
♪ That's good advice ♪
绝对很精彩

00:05:10.514 --> 00:05:12.390
♪ In a world
that's going under ♪
世界的状况越来越差
要生存得心狠手辣

00:05:12.474 --> 00:05:14.351
♪ To survive,
you must learn to plunder ♪
世界的状况越来越差
要生存得心狠手辣

00:05:14.434 --> 00:05:16.770
♪ Luckily, that's my field
of expertise ♪
好在这方面是我的专长

00:05:16.853 --> 00:05:17.896
He's the best.
他最棒了

00:05:17.979 --> 00:05:19.022
♪ He's a robbing, thieving ♪
他是强盗小偷

00:05:19.105 --> 00:05:20.065
We really should be leaving.
我们真的要走了

00:05:20.148 --> 00:05:21.191
♪ Weapon-throwing ♪
飞刀高手

00:05:21.274 --> 00:05:22.108
We got to get going.
我们该上路了

00:05:22.192 --> 00:05:23.193
♪ Sloth-slaying ♪
树懒杀手

00:05:23.276 --> 00:05:24.194
Ah, wish
we could be staying.
我也想再留一会儿

00:05:24.277 --> 00:05:26.905
♪ Undisputed, uncontested,
monkey-suited ♪
臭名昭著 独步江湖

00:05:26.988 --> 00:05:28.281
-Hey!
-♪ Yeah, you guessed it ♪
猴貌岸然 你心里有数

00:05:28.365 --> 00:05:30.784
♪ Master of the seas ♪
海洋的霸主

00:05:30.867 --> 00:05:31.827
Oh, please.
哦 省省吧

00:05:31.910 --> 00:05:33.995
♪ That's me ♪
♪ 'Tis he ♪
就是我 没错

00:05:34.079 --> 00:05:34.996
♪ It's who ♪
♪ It's you ♪
就是谁 是你

00:05:35.080 --> 00:05:37.916
♪ Just testing, I knew--
it's me ♪
就是我

00:05:38.542 --> 00:05:39.876
Good shanty, sir.
唱得真好 先生

00:05:40.293 --> 00:05:41.545
Captain Gutt?
肚肚船长 真的假的

00:05:41.628 --> 00:05:42.879
(chuckles)
Really?
肚肚船长 真的假的

00:05:42.963 --> 00:05:44.297
You know, I have
a little paunch, too,
我也有点腹部赘肉但是

00:05:44.381 --> 00:05:46.967
but, uh, I wouldn't
name myself after it.
我不会用这个当我的名字

00:05:47.050 --> 00:05:48.385
(laughs)

00:05:48.468 --> 00:05:49.386
That's funny.
非常幽默 你是个幽默的人

00:05:49.469 --> 00:05:50.637
You're a funny guy.
非常幽默 你是个幽默的人

00:05:50.971 --> 00:05:52.514
But that's not
how I got my name.
但这不是我名字的来源

00:05:52.973 --> 00:05:55.225
These got me my name.
这个 才是名字的来源

00:05:55.308 --> 00:05:56.142
I don't get it.
我没有听懂

00:05:56.226 --> 00:05:57.060
No?
不懂 好吧

00:05:57.143 --> 00:05:58.436
-Okay.
-(gasps)
不懂 好吧

00:05:58.520 --> 00:06:00.021
Let me give you
a visual aid.
我来给你做个示范

00:06:00.105 --> 00:06:01.982
I just gently press here.
我只要轻轻地按一下这儿

00:06:02.065 --> 00:06:02.941
(laughs):
That tickles!
痒死我了

00:06:03.024 --> 00:06:06.111
And go down like this.
然后一路这样拉到底

00:06:06.194 --> 00:06:07.195
(gasps)
然后一路这样拉到底

00:06:07.529 --> 00:06:10.407
And then your innards
become your outards.
就变成外脏了

00:06:10.490 --> 00:06:12.033
(laughs)

00:06:12.117 --> 00:06:14.035
Um, I still don't get it.
我还是没听懂

00:06:14.578 --> 00:06:17.247
Look, as much as I'm tempted
to join a monkey,
听着 尽管我有兴趣结交你这个

00:06:17.664 --> 00:06:20.584
the Easter Bunny,
and a giant bag of pudding...
还有那个超大号的布丁

00:06:20.667 --> 00:06:21.501
(chuckles)
还有那个超大号的布丁

00:06:21.585 --> 00:06:23.044
...I'll pass.
但还是算了

00:06:23.128 --> 00:06:25.046
No one's going to stop me
from getting back to my family.
没人能阻止我回到家人的身边

00:06:25.130 --> 00:06:28.300
-(gasps)
-I'm gonna lambada with your liver, buddy!
我要切了你这个不识好歹的东西

00:06:28.383 --> 00:06:29.384
(yells)

00:06:29.467 --> 00:06:30.802
Let me at him. Ow!
别拦着我

00:06:30.886 --> 00:06:32.178
(chuckles)

00:06:32.262 --> 00:06:37.434
That family is going
to be the death of you.
就是你丢掉性命的理由

00:06:37.517 --> 00:06:39.603
First mate, jettison
the deadweight.
大副 处理掉那些累赘

00:06:39.686 --> 00:06:41.479
Aye-aye, sir.
Prepare the plank!
遵命 先生
把跳板准备好

00:06:41.563 --> 00:06:42.564
Prepare the plank!
把跳板准备好

00:06:42.647 --> 00:06:43.481
(sighs)
把跳板准备好

00:06:43.565 --> 00:06:44.524
Preparing the plank!
把跳板准备好

00:06:44.608 --> 00:06:45.817
GUPTA: Prepare the plank!
这就准备跳板

00:06:46.192 --> 00:06:47.027
Ow!

00:06:47.444 --> 00:06:49.154
What, you want me to
walk into the water?
什么 你要我跳进水里

00:06:49.237 --> 00:06:52.198
I can't 'cause I just ate
less than 20 minutes ago,
我二十分钟前刚吃饭 不能游泳的

00:06:52.282 --> 00:06:53.199
and you know the rule.
我二十分钟前刚吃饭 不能游泳的

00:06:53.283 --> 00:06:54.367
That's a myth.
放心吧 没事

00:06:54.451 --> 00:06:55.368
Oh, okay.
好吧 只要没事就行

00:06:55.452 --> 00:06:56.828
Long as it's safe.
好吧 只要没事就行

00:06:57.203 --> 00:06:58.038
(gasps)

00:06:58.121 --> 00:06:59.372
(screams)

00:06:59.456 --> 00:07:00.373
Wait!
等等

00:07:00.457 --> 00:07:01.374
Oh, thank goodness.
谢天谢地

00:07:01.458 --> 00:07:03.418
-Dump the wench, too.
-CREW: Arr!
把母的也丢了

00:07:04.252 --> 00:07:06.212
Ladies first.
女士优先

00:07:06.296 --> 00:07:08.340
Such a nice boy.
真是个好孩子

00:07:08.423 --> 00:07:10.759
Why can't you be
more like him, Sidney?
你怎么不向他学学 希德

00:07:10.842 --> 00:07:11.676
Granny, no!
你怎么不向他学学 希德

00:07:11.760 --> 00:07:13.136
-Wait!
-(laughter)
奶奶 不 等等

00:07:13.553 --> 00:07:14.387
(grunting)

00:07:14.471 --> 00:07:16.014
DIEGO: Manny!
曼尼

00:07:16.097 --> 00:07:17.182
Get me to the vine.
送我到绳子那儿

